fishing-rod-slot-line = line
fishing-rod-slot-hook = hook
fishing-rod-slot-bait = bait

fishing-bait-can-empty = The can is empty!
fishing-bait-can-wait = You need to wait a bit before taking more.
fishing-bait-slot-full = There is already bait on this rod.
fishing-bait-not-bait = This rod cannot take that bait.
fishing-rod-no-bait-examine = It does not have any bait attached. Fishing will be more tedious.
fishing-no-hook = Install a hook on this rod first!

ent-FishingLine = fishing line reel
    .desc = A fishing line. In spite of its simplicity, the added length makes casting a bit easier.
ent-FishingLineReinforced = reinforced fishing line reel
    .desc = Essential for fishing in extreme environments.
ent-FishingLineCloaked = cloaked fishing line reel
    .desc = Even harder to notice than the common variety.
ent-FishingLineBouncy = flexible fishing line reel
    .desc = This specialized line is much harder to snap.
ent-FishingLineSinew = fishing sinew
    .desc = An all-natural fishing line made of stretched out sinew. A bit stiff, but usable in extreme environments.
ent-FishingLineAutoReel = fishing line auto-reel
    .desc = Automatically spins the lure and starts reeling in the fish the moment it bites.
ent-FishingLineBluespace = bluespace fishing line
    .desc = A fishing line capable of phasing through the very fabric of reality, along with any hook or bait attached to it.

ent-FishingHook = simple fishing hook
    .desc = A simple fishing hook. Don't expect to hook onto anything without one.
ent-FishingHookMagnet = magnetic hook
    .desc = Won't make catching fish any easier, but it might help with looking for other things.
ent-FishingHookShiny = shiny lure hook
    .desc = Used to attract shiny-loving fish and make them easier to catch.
ent-FishingHookAnomaly = anomalous lure hook
    .desc = A hook that reacts to the strange energies of deep water. Most anomalous cores could have a unique effect on it.
ent-FishingHookWeighted = weighted hook
    .desc = Reduces the bounce when the bait hits the boundaries of the minigame bar.
ent-FishingHookRescue = rescue hook
    .desc = An unwieldy hook meant to help with rescuing those that have fallen down in chasms. It won't catch any fish.
ent-FishingHookBone = bone hook
    .desc = A simple hook carved from sharpened bone.
ent-FishingHookGyro = gyro-stabilized hook
    .desc = A quirky hook that lets you move the bait both up and down while reeling in.
ent-FishingHookJaws = jawed hook
    .desc = A gritty beartrap-looking hook. Losing a hooked fish is impossible with it, but it will hurt the catch.

ent-BaitWorm = worm
    .desc = A wriggly little worm. Fish love it.
ent-BaitWormPremium = premium worm
    .desc = A fat, juicy worm that fish find irresistible.
ent-BaitDoughball = doughball
    .desc = A ball of dough moulded for fishing.
ent-BaitDoughballBlue = blue doughball
    .desc = A ball of blue dough, a favourite of picky fish.
ent-BaitDoughballSuper = super doughball
    .desc = A doughball made with the nectar of the gods.
ent-FishingBaitSynthetic = synthetic bait
    .desc = Endless synthetic bait produced by the rod itself.

ent-FishingLureMinnow = artificial minnow
    .desc = A fishing lure that may attract small fish. Picky prey won't be interested in it.
ent-FishingLurePlug = artificial plug lure
    .desc = A bigger fishing lure that may attract larger fish.
ent-FishingLureDropping = plastic dropping
    .desc = A fishing lure for all sorts of slimy, ratty and junk-loving fish.
ent-FishingLureSpoon = spoon lure
    .desc = A lustrous piece of metal mimicking the scales of a fish. Specializes in small freshwater fish.
ent-FishingLureArtificialFly = artificial fly
    .desc = A soft, wooly fly. Fancy enough to catch the interest of picky fish, but only those.
ent-FishingLureLed = LED fishing lure
    .desc = A heavy, waterproof LED stick, specialized in catching nocturnal fish.
ent-FishingLureLuckyCoin = lucky coin lure
    .desc = A faux-gold lure. Catches the attention of fish that love shinies.
ent-FishingLureAlgae = plastic algae lure
    .desc = A soft clump of fake algae. Herbivores love it, nothing else does.
ent-FishingLureGrub = grub lure
    .desc = A soft plastic lure with a twisting tail, made for small fish.
ent-FishingLureBuzzbait = buzzbait lure
    .desc = A metallic clanker on a series of cables, alluring to electric fish.
ent-FishingLureSpinnerbait = spinnerbait lure
    .desc = A spinny, vulnerable lure, great for attracting freshwater predators.
ent-FishingLureDaisyChain = daisy chain lure
    .desc = A lure resembling a small school of fish. Saltwater predators love it.

ent-BaitCan = can o bait
    .desc = There's a lot of them in there, getting them out takes a while though.
ent-BaitCanWorm = can o' worm
    .desc = This can got worms.
ent-BaitCanWormPremium = can o' worm deluxe
    .desc = This can got fancy worms.
ent-BaitCanSuper = can o' super-baits
    .desc = This can got the nectar of god.

ent-FishingRodBone = bone fishing rod
    .desc = A humble rod, made with whatever happened to be on hand.
ent-FishingRodScience = advanced fishing rod
    .desc = An embedded universal constructor makes this marvel of technology never run out of bait.
ent-FishingRodTelescopic = telescopic fishing rod
    .desc = A lightweight, ergonomic, easy to store telescopic fishing rod.
ent-FishingRodMaster = master fishing rod
    .desc = The mythical rod of a lost fisher king. Said to be imbued with unparalleled fishing power.
ent-FishingRodRescue = rescue fishing rod
    .desc = A mining order console rod with a rescue hook. It can pull people and items out of places you cannot reach.
ent-FishingRodMaterial = material fishing rod
    .desc = A custom fishing rod from your local autolathe.

fishing-rod-luck-examine = Catch luck: { $percent }% of the best rod.
fishing-rod-equipment-verb = Inspect equipment
fishing-rod-equipment-title = Rod equipment
fishing-rod-slot-eject = Take out
fishing-rod-slot-empty = Empty

fishing-gene-gun-slot = injector
fishing-gene-gun-title = Fish trait extraction
fishing-gene-gun-pick-trait = Choose the trait to extract:
fishing-gene-gun-empty = The gene-gun is empty!
fishing-gene-gun-full = The gene-gun is already loaded.
fishing-gene-gun-loaded = You load the gene-gun.
fishing-gene-gun-syringe-not-empty = The gene-gun can only take an empty syringe.
fishing-gene-gun-unloaded = You unload the gene-gun.
fishing-gene-gun-dead = The gene-gun does not work on dead fish.
fishing-gene-gun-no-traits = This fish has no traits that can be extracted.
fishing-gene-gun-extracted = You extract the { $trait } trait into the injector.
fishing-gene-gun-examine-empty = It's currently unloaded. Insert an empty syringe or a fish trait injector.
fishing-gene-gun-examine-extract = It is loaded with a syringe. Use it on a fish to extract a trait.
fishing-gene-gun-examine-inject = It is loaded with a trait injector. Use it on a fish to inject the trait.
fishing-gene-has-trait = This fish already has the { $trait } trait.
fishing-gene-injected = You inject the { $trait } trait into the fish.
fishing-gene-injector-empty = This injector has no trait stored in it.
fishing-gene-injector-examine = It contains the { $trait } trait.
fishing-gene-injector-named = fish trait injector ({ $trait })

ent-FishingGeneGun = fish gene-gun
    .desc = A device designed to inject or extract traits to and from fish. It takes an empty syringe and turns it into a fish trait injector. Repeated applications may kill the fish.
ent-FishGeneInjector = fish trait injector
    .desc = A single-use injector containing a fish trait. It can be applied directly to a living fish, or loaded into a gene-gun.

fishing-lure-spin-examine = It has to be clicked { $min } to { $max } seconds after the cast, while the light above the float is green.

fishing-need-reinforced-line = The line will burn in there. Only reinforced or sinew line can fish in lava.
fishing-catch-poisoned = The bait was poisonous! { $fish } does not survive.

fishing-anomaly-core-slot = anomaly core
fishing-anomaly-core-invalid = This hook only accepts an anomaly core.
fishing-anomaly-core-installed = The core clicks into place.
fishing-anomaly-core-examine = There is { $core } slotted into it.
fishing-anomaly-core-effects = An active core can add a special effect to the catch. Gravity cores make the lure sink slower, bluespace cores alter the catch materials, and flesh cores alter the catch size, weight and traits.

